## 8. SUBSCRIPTION AND PAYWALL

### Free limits:
- Maximum 5 recipes
- Maximum 20 ingredients
- No PDF export
- No CSV import
- No cloud sync — local only

### Hobbyist $4.99/month:
- Unlimited recipes
- Unlimited ingredients
- Cloud sync across devices

### Pro $19/month:
- Everything in Hobbyist
- PDF export
- CSV import
- Price history charts
- Wholesale quote generation

### Paywall trigger points:
- User tries to create 6th recipe — show paywall
- User tries to add 21st ingredient — show paywall
- User taps PDF export button — show paywall
- User taps CSV import button — show paywall

### useSubscription hook behavior:
- Reads subscription_tier from profiles table
- Exposes isFree, isHobbyist, isPro booleans
- Exposes canCreateRecipe(count), canAddIngredient(count), canExportPDF, canImportCSV
- Used everywhere to gate features — never hardcode tier checks in screens

### RevenueCat flow:
- User subscribes in app
- RevenueCat processes payment via App Store or Play Store
- RevenueCat webhook fires to Supabase Edge Function
- Edge Function updates profiles.subscription_tier
- Never update subscription_tier manually anywhere else

