## 13. V2 FEATURES — DO NOT BUILD IN V1

- AI invoice scanning — photo to auto update ingredient prices
- Price history charts — ingredient cost trends over time
- Nutrition tracking — calories and macros per serving
- Allergen tracking — flag common allergens per recipe
- Team collaboration — share recipes with staff
- Wholesale quote generation — bulk pricing calculator
- POS integration — connect to Square or Toast
- Multi-language support

