## 14. KEY REMINDERS

- JavaScript only — never TypeScript
- Never store payment data in Supabase — RevenueCat owns all payment data
- Always handle empty state — new users have zero data
- Unit conversion is the most critical feature — always test edge cases
- Never calculate costs inside component code — always use calculations.js
- Pre-load sample data on first login — empty state kills apps
- RLS always on — never disable
- FlatList for all lists — never map inside ScrollView
- All currency formatted using user currency from user_settings
- RevenueCat webhook updates subscription_tier — never update it manually

